id: stretch
name: Stretch
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Acrobatics
# Held by whoever meets it: the Skill and the Ranks it asks.
requiresSkill: acrobatics
requiresRanks: 2
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 2 Minutes
# Done: the Stretched mark, which the next Combat Encounter turns into its first 3 Combat Rounds.
gains: stretched
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Two minutes limbering up: enter a Combat Encounter within the hour, and your Combat Rolls are
  1(T) better for its first 3 Combat Rounds.
text: >
  Stretch: You limber up for battle, stretching your muscles to prepare for the rigors of strenuous
  combat.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Acrobatics
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 2 Minutes
  –Effect: If you enter a Combat Encounter within the next hour, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(T)
  for the first 3 Combat Rounds of that Combat Encounter.

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Acrobatics. The card's button, once the
# Time Cost is spent, gives the Stretched mark; entering a Combat Encounter puts it on a clock of the
# first 3 Combat Rounds, and the Encounter ending takes it off whatever is left. "Within the next
# hour" is story time: the player ends the mark by hand if the hour passes first.
